"Black Marble Hall - Red Runes"
"This is a black marble corridor leading east and west under an arched ceiling.
The stone of the floor and walls is smooth and spotless, save for windows in
the walls to the north and south, and reflects images in the room as clearly
as any mirror.  Dark red runes are arrayed in a line running north and south
across the hallway, throbbing menacingly.  Above, a white orb hangs on a
silver chain, lighting the hall with a pale light.  To the east is an arched
entrance, leading into a checkered marble room, with a portal standing on a
dais in the center of it.  The hallway continues to the west, where blue-white
runes can be seen on the floor.
"
