"Bedchamber"
"Cushions lie all over the cool stone floor in this room, a variety of rich
colors and textures adorning their fabric.  Warm-hued wall-hangings are
suspended along every side of the room, bare wall only visible through
openings in the tapestries where torch-filled sconces are set.  A complex,
beautiful chandelier of iron and crystal hangs directly above a lavish, soft-
looking bed in the center of the room.  The only exit is a small stone door
set in the center of the western wall.
"
